    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game is only available in Japanese.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no English translation at this time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being asked by his childhood friend, a young man becomes her assistant in a small detective agency.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mysteries unfold, you'll solve puzzles, fight enemies, and uncover hidden truths behind a series of strange incidents.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your target: the notorious phantom thief \u201cObrutale,\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a figure both feared and admired throughout the kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is his true purpose?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a personal project, developed as a hobby over five years. I hope you enjoy it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game is only available in Japanese.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no English translation at this time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being asked by his childhood friend, a young man becomes her assistant in a small detective agency.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mysteries unfold, you'll solve puzzles, fight enemies, and uncover hidden truths behind a series of strange incidents.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your target: the notorious phantom thief \u201cObrutale,\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a figure both feared and admired throughout the kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is his true purpose?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a personal project, developed as a hobby over five years. I hope you enjoy it.</p>",
    "short_description": "On the night of the full moon, a young man becomes assistant to his childhood friend, a detective. They take on guild quests, solve mysteries, and chase the phantom thief \u201cObrutale,\u201d a figure both feared and admired. A mystery RPG full of story, battles, and secrets.",
